==Overview==
The Juggernaut Astro Toilet is an [[Toilet|enemy]] that has been released in the [[Episode 75 Update]].

==Appearance==
The Juggernaut Astro Toilet appears to be an enemy that has 2 mounted gravity guns on each of its arms and a gas mask with glowing eyes, possibly from Russian descent. It has 4 fingers on each of its hands and claws on its right arm, with a shield on its left.

==Waves==
* Stated by Telanthric, the Juggernaut Astro Toilet will be appearing from "beyond Wave 150", meaning he will probably be a new boss in [[Endless Mode]].

==Abilities==
When its shield is up, it's immune to attacks for 5 seconds.

==Strategy==
Use Ultra Time Stop of [[Upgraded Titan Clockman]] and the Rewind ability of [[Chief Clockman]].

==Trivia==

*Telanthric mistook this unit for the original [[Secutor Astro Toilet]], but upgraded.
*This enemy is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Scout_Astro_Toilet Scout Astro Toilet] from the Skibidi Toilet Series.

